course: dictionary
lesson: 593
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: One word can have more than one meaning. The words around it, its context, show you which meaning to use.
explain: «Lily designed and dressed her avatar before the game began.» Design and dress tell you an avatar is a picture or character that stands for you in a game. That is the meaning used most in games and online chat.
explain: «She was an avatar of kindness.» There is no game or screen here. Avatar means a person who perfectly shows an idea, here kindness.
fact: An avatar is a picture or character that stands for you in a game, app or online chat.
fact: «Avatar» comes from Sanskrit, the ancient language of India.
fact: In Hindu belief, an avatar is a god appearing on Earth in a human or animal form, such as Krishna, an avatar of Vishnu.
fact: «An avatar of kindness» means a person who perfectly shows an idea.
fact: A cartoon avatar can be used instead of a real photo online, which is safer.
exercise: «Lily designed and dressed her avatar before the game began.» What is an avatar here? | A type of ancient language | A god coming to Earth as an animal | A person who perfectly shows kindness | *A picture or character that stands for you in a game
exercise: In Hindu belief, what is an avatar? | A cloud shaped like a bird | A kind teacher at school | An old map of India | *A god appearing on Earth in human or animal form
exercise: «Her grandma was an avatar of kindness.» What does avatar mean here? | *A person who perfectly shows an idea | A god who lives in the sky | A character in a computer game | A cartoon picture of a person
test: Why is a cartoon avatar safer than a real photo online? | It stops other people from playing games | It is easier to draw than a photo | It makes your picture bigger on the screen | *Your real face is not shown
test: Which word came into English from Sanskrit? | Castle | *Avatar | Dinner | Robot
exam: Which meaning fits «The coach was an avatar of fairness»? | A god who lives on Earth in a temple | A character in a game you design | A cartoon film about a hero | *A person who perfectly shows an idea
